{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21108","headline":"谕宝二首 一 · 元稹","name":"谕宝二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈玉在弱泥，泥弱玉易沈。\n扶桑寒日薄，不照万丈心。\n安得潜渊虯，拔壑超邓林。\n泥封泰山址，水散旱天霖。\n洗此泥下玉，照耀台殿深。\n刻爲传国宝，神器人不侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}